BT 1 0 0 1 0 158.5 Tm 9 0 Td 3.05465 Tw /F3+0 8.7 Tf 15.2 TL (First Impressions Matter stopped feeling abstract to me once I started) Tj T* 0 Tw -9 0 Td .840692 Tw (looking at the problem through the eyes of an operations team carrying both) Tj T* 0 Tw .001867 Tw (urgency and fatigue. In moments like that, the ability to move quickly matters,) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.974522 Tw (but speed becomes destructive when teams start mistaking motion for) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.049854 Tw (judgment. The obstacle was often not a dramatic failure but pressure to look) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.399667 Tw (decisive even when the facts were still incomplete. People do not measure a) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.698641 Tw (financial system the same way insiders do. They ask whether it respects) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.080079 Tw (caution, whether it explains itself in time, and whether it leaves room for) Tj T* 0 Tw .555673 Tw (correction before a mistake becomes permanent. That is why I kept returning) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.166255 Tw (to pauses that clarified ownership. It lowered not only technical friction, but) Tj T* 0 Tw (the emotional cost of participation.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
