BT 1 0 0 1 0 143.3 Tm 9 0 Td .98144 Tw /F3+0 8.7 Tf 15.2 TL (What made the situation difficult was the overlap of responsibilities. While) Tj T* 0 Tw -9 0 Td .85397 Tw (trying to maintain speed and verification, we also faced fragmented feedback) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.503682 Tw (coming from users, regulators, and critics at the same time. Under those) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.198963 Tw (conditions, organizations often reach for theater: louder language, faster) Tj T* 0 Tw .529177 Tw (reactions, broader claims. I learned to distrust that instinct. The more durable) Tj T* 0 Tw .179389 Tw (answer was usually operational: pauses that clarified ownership; release habits) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.326287 Tw (that separated reversible experiments from irreversible commitments; and a) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.965895 Tw (willingness to keep explaining the same reality until confusion began to) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.673575 Tw (shrink. Reliability is less glamorous than velocity, but users remember it) Tj T* 0 Tw (longer.) Tj T* ET
