BT 1 0 0 1 0 97.7 Tm 9 0 Td 1.566468 Tw /F3+0 8.7 Tf 15.2 TL (My instincts today are less impressed by rhetoric and more persuaded by) Tj T* 0 Tw -9 0 Td 1.972191 Tw (repeatable care. Speed should serve users, not just headlines. I also believe) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.196804 Tw (restraint is not the opposite of ambition, because the people affected by a) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.520791 Tw (product decision do not experience it as strategy; they experience it as) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.918456 Tw (interruption, relief, delay, or dignity. The builders who remember that) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.415254 Tw (distinction will make better systems over time. A durable system is not one) Tj T* 0 Tw (that avoids criticism; it is one that learns before criticism becomes catastrophe.) Tj T* ET
