BT 1 0 0 1 0 158.5 Tm 9 0 Td 3.05465 Tw /F3+0 8.7 Tf 15.2 TL (First Impressions Matter stopped feeling abstract to me once I started) Tj T* 0 Tw -9 0 Td 2.812692 Tw (looking at the problem through the eyes of a manager deciding what to) Tj T* 0 Tw .052655 Tw (communicate first. In moments like that, under pressure, culture stops being a) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.193958 Tw (poster and becomes the pattern of what people do when the script fails. The) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.003432 Tw (obstacle was often not a dramatic failure but moments when loyalty made) Tj T* 0 Tw .998379 Tw (people avoid hard truths. People do not measure a financial system the same) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.937786 Tw (way insiders do. They ask whether it respects caution, whether it explains) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.338179 Tw (itself in time, and whether it leaves room for correction before a mistake) Tj T* 0 Tw .007968 Tw (becomes permanent. That is why I kept returning to postmortems that focused) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.074323 Tw (on learning before blame. It lowered not only technical friction, but the) Tj T* 0 Tw (emotional cost of participation.) Tj T* ET
Q
