BT 1 0 0 1 0 128.1 Tm 9 0 Td .98144 Tw /F3+0 8.7 Tf 15.2 TL (What made the situation difficult was the overlap of responsibilities. While) Tj T* 0 Tw -9 0 Td .314445 Tw (trying to maintain openness and abuse prevention, we also faced the tendency) Tj T* 0 Tw .472029 Tw (of fast systems to hide slow failures until they became expensive. Under those) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.198963 Tw (conditions, organizations often reach for theater: louder language, faster) Tj T* 0 Tw .529177 Tw (reactions, broader claims. I learned to distrust that instinct. The more durable) Tj T* 0 Tw .622122 Tw (answer was usually operational: postmortems that focused on learning before) Tj T* 0 Tw .330292 Tw (blame; shared language for bad news; and a willingness to keep explaining the) Tj T* 0 Tw .219932 Tw (same reality until confusion began to shrink. Reliability is less glamorous than) Tj T* 0 Tw (velocity, but users remember it longer.) Tj T* ET
