BT 1 0 0 1 0 112.9 Tm 9 0 Td 1.566468 Tw /F3+0 8.7 Tf 15.2 TL (My instincts today are less impressed by rhetoric and more persuaded by) Tj T* 0 Tw -9 0 Td .628889 Tw (repeatable care. Panic spreads through ambiguity. I also believe organizations) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.091045 Tw (become more humane when they prepare for their least flattering moments,) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.551692 Tw (because the people affected by a product decision do not experience it as) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.02723 Tw (strategy; they experience it as interruption, relief, delay, or dignity. The) Tj T* 0 Tw .364273 Tw (builders who remember that distinction will make better systems over time. A) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.785558 Tw (durable system is not one that avoids criticism; it is one that learns before) Tj T* 0 Tw (criticism becomes catastrophe.) Tj T* ET
