BT 1 0 0 1 0 158.5 Tm 9 0 Td 3.05465 Tw /F3+0 8.7 Tf 15.2 TL (First Impressions Matter stopped feeling abstract to me once I started) Tj T* 0 Tw -9 0 Td 1.267908 Tw (looking at the problem through the eyes of a user who wants to understand) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.054736 Tw (risk before taking action. In moments like that, lasting participation in open) Tj T* 0 Tw .105645 Tw (financial systems depends less on hype than on patient education that respects) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.457635 Tw (how steep the learning curve can be. The obstacle was often not a dramatic) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.34465 Tw (failure but glossaries that answered vocabulary but not judgment. People do) Tj T* 0 Tw .41765 Tw (not measure a financial system the same way insiders do. They ask whether it) Tj T* 0 Tw .218642 Tw (respects caution, whether it explains itself in time, and whether it leaves room) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.159345 Tw (for correction before a mistake becomes permanent. That is why I kept) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.965395 Tw (returning to examples grounded in everyday decisions. It lowered not only) Tj T* 0 Tw (technical friction, but the emotional cost of participation.) Tj T* ET
