BT 1 0 0 1 0 97.7 Tm 9 0 Td 1.566468 Tw /F3+0 8.7 Tf 15.2 TL (My instincts today are less impressed by rhetoric and more persuaded by) Tj T* 0 Tw -9 0 Td .758906 Tw (repeatable care. Excitement converts faster than understanding. I also believe) Tj T* 0 Tw .514804 Tw (instruction is part of user protection, because the people affected by a product) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.490132 Tw (decision do not experience it as strategy; they experience it as interruption,) Tj T* 0 Tw .167732 Tw (relief, delay, or dignity. The builders who remember that distinction will make) Tj T* 0 Tw .024282 Tw (better systems over time. A durable system is not one that avoids criticism; it is) Tj T* 0 Tw (one that learns before criticism becomes catastrophe.) Tj T* ET
