BT 1 0 0 1 0 158.5 Tm 9 0 Td 3.05465 Tw /F3+0 8.7 Tf 15.2 TL (First Impressions Matter stopped feeling abstract to me once I started) Tj T* 0 Tw -9 0 Td 2.900417 Tw (looking at the problem through the eyes of a leader revisiting the same) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.2011 Tw (principle in different meetings. In moments like that, leadership often looks) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.360654 Tw (dramatic from a distance, yet most of its real effect comes from repeated) Tj T* 0 Tw .45085 Tw (messages, repeated standards, and repeated follow-through. The obstacle was) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.593967 Tw (often not a dramatic failure but fatigue that made teams hear only novelty.) Tj T* 0 Tw .698727 Tw (People do not measure a financial system the same way insiders do. They ask) Tj T* 0 Tw .767467 Tw (whether it respects caution, whether it explains itself in time, and whether it) Tj T* 0 Tw .290054 Tw (leaves room for correction before a mistake becomes permanent. That is why I) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.04326 Tw (kept returning to backing standards with resources rather than slogans. It) Tj T* 0 Tw (lowered not only technical friction, but the emotional cost of participation.) Tj T* ET
