BT 1 0 0 1 0 112.9 Tm 9 0 Td 1.566468 Tw /F3+0 8.7 Tf 15.2 TL (My instincts today are less impressed by rhetoric and more persuaded by) Tj T* 0 Tw -9 0 Td .768032 Tw (repeatable care. Risk improves when language improves. I also believe a good) Tj T* 0 Tw .671541 Tw (vocabulary can prevent a bad surprise from becoming a bad decision, because) Tj T* 0 Tw .459812 Tw (the people affected by a product decision do not experience it as strategy; they) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.37349 Tw (experience it as interruption, relief, delay, or dignity. The builders who) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.647475 Tw (remember that distinction will make better systems over time. A durable) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.352565 Tw (system is not one that avoids criticism; it is one that learns before criticism) Tj T* 0 Tw (becomes catastrophe.) Tj T* ET
